WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.170
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No claiming to be, or

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.950
to have ever been, Steve Irwin!

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.200
How dare you?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.800
Steve Irwin was an international treasure,
and you will never, ever fill his sensible

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.000
shoes, Dr. Bright.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.590
No matter how much you say "crikey" when looking
at SCP-682, no matter how many times you call

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:31.240
it a "mighty big croc!", no matter how much
you photoshop yourself into photos of SCP-682

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:36.699
or how many Australians you possess, you will
never be The Crocodile Hunter.

00:00:36.699 --> 00:00:40.489
Stop trying to make it happen, no one is going
to call you that.

00:00:40.489 --> 00:00:45.249
And stop tricking interns into buying autographed
memorabilia from you, we all know it's a forgery.

